## Layout

```
agent-native-sdlc/
├── install.py              installs into a target repository
├── playbook/               → .sdlc/playbook/   stage procedures, references, review passes
├── templates/              → AGENTS.md, REVIEW.md, .sdlc/templates/
├── guards/                 → .sdlc/guards/     one script per guard, every hook dialect
├── enforcement/            → .sdlc/enforcement/, .github/workflows/sdlc-gate.yml, pre-push
├── monitor/                → .sdlc/monitor/    metric watcher for stage 5
├── adapters/               per-agent rules and hook configs
├── SOURCES.md              everything read to build this, and what each source settled
└── .mirror-source.json     the source commit this was generated from
```

## Customization

Every organization-specific decision is marked `TODO:` in the file that needs
it — the protected paths, the deploy commands, who authorizes a release, which
review passes apply.

```bash
grep -rn "TODO:" AGENTS.md REVIEW.md .sdlc/
```

